    ("total reward statement", "BrE /ˌtəʊtl rɪˈwɔːd ˌsteɪtmənt/", "AmE /ˈtoʊtəl ɹɪˈwɔɹd ˈstéɪtmənt/", "整体薪酬说明", "Total reward statements are the cheapest way to show non-cash value.", "整体薪酬说明是展示非现金价值最省钱的办法。"),
    ("benefits communication", "BrE /ˈbenɪfɪts kəˌmjuːnɪˈkeɪʃn/", "AmE /ˈbɛnəfɪts kəˌmjunəˈkéɪʃən/", "福利沟通", "Benefits communication should explain the value, not list the providers.", "福利沟通应当解释价值，而不是罗列服务商。"),
    ("benefits enrolment", "BrE /ˈbenɪfɪts ɪnˌrəʊlmənt/", "AmE /ˈbɛnəfɪts ɛˈnɹoʊlmənt/", "福利登记", "Benefits enrolment windows should be long enough for people to compare.", "福利登记窗口应当留出足够时间让员工比较。"),
    ("eligibility", "BrE /ˌelɪdʒəˈbɪləti/", "AmE /ˌɛlɪdʒəˈbɪlɪti/", "资格条件", "Eligibility rules that people cannot check themselves cause disputes.", "员工无法自行核对的资格规则会引发争议。"),
    ("dependent", "BrE /dɪˈpendənt/", "AmE /dɪˈpɛndənt/", "家属；被抚养人", "Dependent coverage definitions should name the relationships covered.", "家属保障的定义应当写明覆盖哪些亲属关系。"),
    ("payslip", "BrE /ˈpeɪslɪp/", "AmE /ˈpeɪslɪp/", "工资单", "Payslips should show the calculation, not just the result.", "工资单应当展示计算过程，而不只是结果。"),
    ("payroll", "BrE /ˈpeɪrəʊl/", "AmE /ˈpéɪˌɹoʊl/", "薪资发放", "Payroll accuracy is a trust asset, not an administrative task.", "薪资发放的准确性是信任资产，不是行政杂务。"),
    ("payroll cycle", "BrE /ˈpeɪrəʊl ˌsaɪkl/", "AmE /ˈpéɪˌɹoʊl ˈsɑɪkəl/", "薪资周期", "Payroll cycles that require manual corrections always fail in December.", "需要人工修正的薪资周期，总是在十二月出问题。"),
    ("tax withholding", "BrE /ˈtæks wɪðˈhəʊldɪŋ/", "AmE /ˈtæks wɪˈθhoʊldɪŋ/", "代扣代缴；预扣税", "Tax withholding certificates should be collected before the first pay run.", "代扣代缴资料应当在第一次发薪前收齐。"),
    ("social security contribution", "BrE /ˌsəʊʃl sɪˈkjʊərəti kənˌtrɪˈbjuːʃn/", "AmE /ˈsoʊʃəl sɪˈkjʊɹəti ˌkɑntɹəˈbjuʃən/", "社保缴纳", "Social security contribution rates change and should be reviewed each year.", "社保缴纳比例会变动，应当每年复审。"),
    ("net pay", "BrE /ˈnet peɪ/", "AmE /ˈnɛt ˈpéɪ/", "实发工资；净额", "Net pay surprises damage trust faster than a small salary gap.", "实发工资上的意外，比小幅薪资差距更伤信任。"),
    ("gender pay gap", "BrE /ˈdʒendə peɪ ɡæp/", "AmE /ˈdʒɛndɚ ˈpéɪ ˈɡæp/", "性别薪酬差距", "Gender pay gap statistics describe the market, not the individual.", "性别薪酬差距的统计数据反映的是市场，而不是个人。"),
    ("pay equity audit", "BrE /ˈpeɪ ˌekwəti ˌɔːdɪt/", "AmE /ˈpéɪ ˈɛkwəti ˈɔdɪt/", "薪酬公平审计", "Pay equity audits need remediation budgets, not just a report.", "薪酬公平审计需要整改预算，而不只是报告。"),
    ("pay transparency reporting", "BrE /ˈpeɪ trænsˌpærənsi rɪˈpɔːtɪŋ/", "AmE /ˈpéɪ tɹæˈnspɛɹənsi ɹiˈpɔɹtɪŋ/", "薪酬透明度披露", "Pay transparency reporting becomes normal practice, not a surprise.", "薪酬透明度披露正在变成常规做法，而不是意外。"),
    ("retention bonus", "BrE /rɪˈtenʃn ˌbəʊnəs/", "AmE /ɹiˈtɛnʃən ˈboʊnəs/", "留任奖金", "Retention bonuses pay for staying, which should never be the main reason.", "留任奖金是为“留下”付钱，而留下不该是主要理由。"),
    ("retention package", "BrE /rɪˈtenʃn ˌpækɪdʒ/", "AmE /ɹiˈtɛnʃən ˈpækədʒ/", "留任方案", "Retention packages are cheaper than replacing a specialist.", "留任方案比替换一名专家更便宜。"),
    ("stay bonus", "BrE /ˈsteɪ ˌbəʊnəs/", "AmE /ˈstéɪ ˈboʊnəs/", "留任奖", "Stay bonuses tied to a project milestone stop mid-project resignations.", "与项目节点挂钩的留任奖，能阻止项目中途离职。"),
