    ("cost per employee", "BrE /ˌkɒst pər ɪmˈplɔɪə/", "AmE /ˈkɑst ˈpɝ ɛˈmplɔɪi/", "人均成本", "Cost per employee rising faster than revenue is an early warning.", "人均成本增速快于营收，是一个早期预警。"),
